# #5837, the claimless advance and the split hint.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFreeAdvanceIgnoresCloseHeads
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the free advance ignores its marker's close heads, so it passes a handed-off foreign record
PERTURBS: FreeCommit
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ ~hoOpen
    /\ rp[a] >= hoClosedAt - 1
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~hoOpen
\* MUTATION: no close-head bound.
    /\ rp[a] >= seenP[a]
    /\ rp[a] >= seenU[a]
    /\ CloseCarried => rp[a] >= seenS[a]
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] = a => o > ft[a]
--- END
